                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: disheartening; see also Thesaurus:disheartening"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bd1993e-a235-4e7e-8194-c1b335d05140",
                                                "sense_id": "d5811dff-6738-3044-8e73-2b85386e5f7f",
                                                "text": "Oh, give me a home where the Buffalo roam / Where the Deer and the Antelope play; / Where never is heard a discouraging word, / And the sky is not clouded all day"
                                            }
